  "text": "In August 2020 we converged on the postal service. On 2020-08-22, 111 of us said \"for america act\" and 109 said \"delivering for america act\"; 105 said \"the delivering for america\" and 105 said \"the postal service.\" 104 of us said \"the delivering for america act.\" 81 of us said \"25 billion in.\" 62 said \"postal service from\" and 62 said \"postal service to.\"\n\nThe record names Richard Blumenthal as first to say \"for america act,\" in 2013-07-29, and M000087 as first to say \"delivering for america act,\" on 2020-08-12. Chellie Pingree was first to say \"the postal service,\" in 2013-01-15. Richard J. Durbin was first with \"25 billion in,\" in 2013-01-03.\n\nWe repeated one act and one institution, and we peaked on one day. That is what this era's record shows of us.",
